@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# Set token in your HTTP client's secret store; never commit a real token.
@token = REEMPLAZAR_LOCALMENTE

### Public healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Profile creation after Supabase Auth signup/login; fictitious example data
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombres":"Ejemplo","apellidos":"Prueba","tipoDocumento":"DNI","documento":"00000000"}

### Own profile (masked document)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch permitted fields; null/omitted fields remain unchanged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"telefono":"+51900000000"}
